          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 73126,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Membuat variabel untuk setiap temanmu akan membuat kodemu panjang dan kompleks.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend3 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>friend1</code>, diikuti oleh <code>friend2</code>, dan terakhir <code>friend3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Membuat variabel untuk setiap temanmu akan membuat kodemu panjang dan kompleks.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend3 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"friends\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"friend\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"friend4\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>friend1</code>, diikuti oleh <code>friend2</code>, dan terakhir <code>friend3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Square brackets",
            "id": 73127,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Daripada membuat variabel untuk setiap nama teman, kita bisa mengelompokkan semua nilai ke dalam sebuah <strong>array</strong> menggunakan <code>[</code> dan <code>]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tom', 'Mia', 'Lee' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[</code>, diikuti oleh <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kelompokkan nama teman dalam <strong>array</strong> dengan <code>[</code> dan <code>]</code>. Lengkapi deklarasi agar tiga teman ditampilkan sebagai array.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tom', 'Mia', 'Lee' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[</code>, diikuti oleh <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Element",
            "id": 73901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nilai-nilai dalam array disebut <strong>elemen</strong>. Misalnya, <code>\"Tom\"</code>, <code>\"Mia\"</code>, dan <code>\"Lee\"</code> adalah elemen dari array ini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tom', 'Mia', 'Lee' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Lee\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Arrays",
            "id": 73128,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk membuat array kosong, kita menulis <code>[</code> dan <code>]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[</code>, diikuti oleh <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk membuat array kosong, kita menulis <code>[</code> dan <code>]</code>. Lengkapi deklarasi agar array kosong ditampilkan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[</code>, diikuti oleh <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Value in an array",
            "id": 73129,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menempatkan string di antara tanda kurung siku membuat array dengan satu nilai, coba dengan <code>\"Tom\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tom' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>\"Tom\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Arrays",
            "id": 73160,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita menggunakan koma <code>,</code> untuk memisahkan dua nilai atau lebih dalam sebuah array, seperti <code>\"Tom\"</code> dari <code>\"Mia\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tom', 'Mia' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Koma <code>,</code> memisahkan nilai dalam array. Pisahkan <code>\"Tom\"</code> dan <code>\"Mia\"</code> agar array menampilkan keduanya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tom', 'Mia' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Arrays",
            "id": 73161,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Array dapat menampung nilai sebanyak apa pun. Tambahkan nilai lain dengan menuliskan koma, lalu nilainya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tom', 'Mia', 'Lee' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"Lee\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Array dapat menampung berapa pun jumlah value. Tambahkan value lain dengan menulis koma <code>,</code>, lalu value tersebut.</p><p>Perluas array agar mencatat <code>\"Tom\"</code>, <code>\"Mia\"</code>, dan <code>\"Lee\"</code> sesuai urutan tersebut.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Lee\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tom', 'Mia', 'Lee' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"Lee\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Square brackets",
            "id": 73190,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa simbol yang digunakan untuk mengapit nilai dalam array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[</code> dan <code>]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>{</code> dan <code>}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[</code> dan <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu perlu mengapit beberapa nilai dalam array JavaScript. Simbol apa yang kamu gunakan?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[</code> dan <code>]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>{</code> dan <code>}</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>(</code> dan <code>)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[</code> dan <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Element",
            "id": 73902,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa sebutan untuk nilai-nilai dalam sebuah array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">\"Elemen\"</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">\"Kondisi\"</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih \"Elemen\".</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dalam <code>[\"Tom\", \"Mia\"]</code>, apa sebutan untuk <code>\"Tom\"</code> dan <code>\"Mia\"</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Elemen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kondisi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Variabel</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Elemen.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Empty array",
            "id": 73191,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa banyak nilai yang dimiliki array ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" messages = [];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">0</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih 0.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebelum apa pun ditambahkan ke <code>messages</code>, berapa banyak elemen yang dapat disediakan array ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" messages = [];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">0</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak dapat ditentukan hingga array ditampilkan.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih 0.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Value in an array",
            "id": 73192,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa nilai yang dimiliki array ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Coco&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Coco\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Itu tidak memiliki nilai apa pun</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Coco\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kamu membaca satu elemen yang disimpan di <code>pet</code>, nilai apa yang kamu temukan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Coco&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Coco\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Itu tidak memiliki nilai apa pun</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>pet</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Coco\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple values",
            "id": 73193,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa simbol untuk memisahkan nilai dalam array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Koma <code>,</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Titik koma <code>;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koma <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu menambahkan <code>\"Mia\"</code> sebagai elemen kedua dari <code>[\"Tom\"]</code>. Array mana yang memakai pemisah yang benar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"Tom\", \"Mia\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"Tom\"; \"Mia\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"Tom\": \"Mia\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[\"Tom\", \"Mia\"]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
